Today I solved leetcode question number 2180:Count Integers with even digit sum.

Description: The question states that we will be given an integer variable called 'num'.
              And we must return the answer which contains all the integers less than num whose digit sum is even.
              eg- num=15
                  ans=7
                  [2,4,6,8,11,13,15]

Solution: First I created a variable named 'ans'.
          Then I created a for loop from 1 till num.
          And inside for loop I created a while loop which would run till our num is greater than 0.
          And by first using modulo operation by 10 I will get every digit of that number.
          And I will divide that number by 10.
          Then we will add all those digits.
          And at the end we will check if the sum is even or odd.
          If even then we will increase our answer by 1.
          Else we will move to next number.
